  ChangeTimeOfAction: 3
  Text: "It's quite deserted. We got lucky on that one.\n \nNot much around except
    a <link>24/7 Petro Station</link>, which happens to be about twenty feet from
    the <link>truck</link> that we are trying to keep out of sight. \nThat's where
    our luck ends. \n \n<link>Some small vehicle</link> passed through here earlier,
    leaving a   <link>three-wheeled trail</link> on some <link>fluorescent green
    goo</link> that leaked from <link>the cargo</link>. The smear stretches far down
    the road, in the same direction the truck appeared to be headed.  But we got
    rid of all that."
  TextForRepetition: 'We already did that, remember?


    The report is on your
    desk, or in the DB if you uploaded it.'
